        "summary": "Migrated from `.eslintrc.json` to `eslint.config.js` using flat config format. Added `no-restricted-imports` rule to prevent direct `src/` imports in `npm-app/src`. Added `lint` target to `npm-app/project.json` and `eslint` pre-build step. Updated `package.json` to `type: module` and added `typescript-eslint`, `globals`, `eslint-config-prettier` devDeps. Fixed import order and `pino` named import in affected files.",
